#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, preferredBtn)
#: mainpart.ui:62
msgid ""
"Click this to set the currently selected card as the preferred card. The "
"next time kenvy24 starts, this card will be automatically selected."
msgstr ""
"Klick hier, wenn Du de aktuelle Koort as vörtrocken Koort fastleggen wullt. "
"Dat tokamen Maal söökt kenvy24 disse Koort automaatsch ut."

