#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, configList)
#: mainpart.ui:95
msgid "Select a previously saved configuration"
msgstr "En vördem sekert Instellen utsöken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, configList)
#: mainpart.ui:98
msgid ""
"This combo lets you either select a previously created configuration or type "
"the name of a new configuration to be created, then to be saved using the "
"save button next to it."
msgstr ""
"Binnen dit Utsöökfeld kannst Du en vördem opstellt Instellen utsöken, oder "
"den Naam för en nieg Instellen ingeven, ehr denn opstellen, un mit den Knoop "
"blangento sekern."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QToolButton, configSave)
#: mainpart.ui:111
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Ännern sekern"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QToolButton, configSave)
#: mainpart.ui:114
msgid ""
"Press this button to save changes to the configuration selected into the "
"combo. If you typed a new name into the combo, then this button will create "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissenKnoop, wenn Du de Instellen sekern wullt. Wenn Du binnen dat "
"Utsöökfeld en niegen Naam ingeven hest, stellt disse Knoop em op."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QToolButton, configSave)
#: mainpart.ui:117
msgid "S"
msgstr "S"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QToolButton, configDelete)
#: mainpart.ui:127
msgid "Delete configuration"
msgstr "Instellen wegdoon"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QToolButton, configDelete)
#: mainpart.ui:130
msgid ""
"This will permanently delete the current configuration. A deleted "
"configuration will no longer appear into the combo."
msgstr ""
"Dit deit de aktuelle Instellen duerhaftig weg. En wegdaan Instellen dukt "
"nienich wedder in't Ankrüüzfeld op."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QToolButton, configDelete)
#: mainpart.ui:133
msgid "D"
msgstr "W"

